  Text:
    m_Untranslated: '<b>1</b>.  In the <b>Project</b> window, open the <b>Assets</b> > <b>Audio</b> folder.


      <b>2</b>.  Click and drag any of the Audio assets into the <b>Hierarchy</b> window.


      <b>3</b>.  Enter Play mode and listen to the audio you just added.


      <b>Note</b>: If you don''t like the audio, you can delete it from the <b>Hierarchy</b> window by right clicking it and selecting <b>Delete</b>, then drag in a different audio option.'
